    "body": "Hi @mchaput, we try our best to avoid making breaking changes but unfortunately they are not impossible to avoid in a project like starship. I think what happened here is you hit the [v0.45.0 migration](https://starship.rs/migrating-to-0.45.0/) at the time we tried to publish as well as we could but not as well as we liked. One of the out comes of this was that we created  #1403 to versions to our config and to notify the user when they are using an old config version  this should hopefully solve this problems in the future. ",
